<title>INDIA: Indian Oct cement output rises to 5.73 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>Indian Oct cement output rises to 5.73 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian cement production rose in October 1996 to 5.73 million tonnes from 5.45 million in the same month in 1995, the government said on Saturday.</p>
<p>    CEMENT PRODUCTION    Oct 96     Oct 95	   Apr-Oct</p>
<p>								1996    1995</p>
<p>				  5,728	5,449     42,977  38,661</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are in thousands of tonnes and preliminary.</p>
</text>
